{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号浅色标题先进入视线，随后中下部粗体白字和紫色强调句「少露些心意，会不会少疼些？」也非常抢眼。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他很珍惜和对方相处的时光，想确认这份亲近以后也不会改变，却开始担心不能一直这样。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、幸福、不舍，同时有不安、害怕失去的感觉。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他内心更具体的变化：从害怕自己的需要给对方添负担，变成害怕对方有一天不再需要自己；想收起心意来减少受伤，却发现真要退回去，自己反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方标题和中下部粗体段落都是大字号、高亮度，两个视觉块争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块大字中，需要拼接才能理解从珍惜亲近到害怕失去、想隐藏心意又舍不得的完整关系。\",\n    \"下方单块文字较长，包含害怕被抛下、想减少付出、真心难以收回等好几层意思，快速扫视不容易同时拿到。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bb981f62-e4e0-4d85-b1d5-30bd3cadbf1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012022457230Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:21:02.078423+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a8f0742697acdfc9a3e614323b7289f6f2360be3d26eb70696d1c313bd1d94e", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8